{"_note": "Tool-call normalization vectors. raw_input is the assistant message content string, unless it is an object with content/reasoning_content/existing_tool_calls (message-shaped input) or tool_call (alias-normalization input; arguments_raw holds an unparsed argument string). known_tools lists the tool schemas visible to the normalizer. expected.calls is the ordered list of normalized calls ([] = extract nothing, leave content untouched); expected.residual_content, when present, is the message content after consumed spans are stripped and trimmed. expected_outcome 'unrepairable' means the input must not be repaired or extracted. source names the SmallCode file a record derives from; 'synthetic' records were authored for Legion to cover categories SmallCode's tests do not."}
